      "end_ms": 57500,
      "text": "Close-up overhead of the yellowed parchment, showing botanical sketches of toxic herbs and handwritten diagnostic notes as Juliana's finger traces along the script.",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP023_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP023",
